@node Introduction
@chapter Introduction

VolEsti is a C++ library for computing volume approximations and sampling
from convex bodies, particularly polytopes. This package provides an Octave
interface that allows you to use VolEsti functionality from within Octave.

@node Installation
@chapter Installation

To install the VolEsti package for Octave:

@enumerate
@item
Ensure you have Octave installed (version 5.1.0 or later).

@item
Install the required dependencies:
@itemize
@item C++ compiler with C++17 support
@item CMake (>= 3.11)
@item Eigen3
@item Boost libraries
@item lp_solve
@end itemize

@item
Build the MEX files by running CMake in the @code{octave/src} directory:
@example
cd octave/src
mkdir build
cd build
cmake ..
make
@end example

@item
Install the package using Octave's pkg command:
@example
pkg install octave
@end example

@end enumerate

